# Markup+

> A modern markup language with more features than Markdown

## 🚧 Status

Under construction — version `0.1.0`

## ✨ Features

- ✅ Headings (H1, H2, H3)
- ✅ Bold and italic text
- ✅ Inline code
- ✅ Paragraphs

## 📦 Installation

```bash
pip install markup-plus
```

## 🚀 Usage

```bash
mup build file.mup
```

## 📄 Example

```mup
# Hello World

This is **bold** text.

## Section

Inline `code` here.
```

